From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:54:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 096/110] List markers are selected and copied as in the source

Bullets, numbers and task boxes of the preview's lists were left out of
the selection, so a copied list lost its markers. They are now part of
it and copied as Markdown writes them: "- " for a bullet, "1. " for a
number, "- [ ] " and "- [x] " for a task, with the item's text on the
same line.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

